Z||000001||stimpy||12-29-2000||01:52 PM||||And this is Fiero related in what way?  I'm sorry people, I just can't let this slide. This is pure unadulterated spam. I would rather we have 50 Civic "racers" come on this forum and trash us then have this kind of crap fouling up the air here.<P>If you must try to take advantage of us in your pyramid scheme, then at least get to know us first and take it to the off-topic.  Personally, I can't even see how you can attach the so-called legitamacy of Multi-Level marketing to this scam. What exactly is being marketed?  This is nothing but a pyramid scheme where last loser on the pile gets nothing.  This is highly illegal and unethical and it pisses me off that you would bring it here. I guess I can't be too hard on you for disrespecting us, it sounds like you have no respect for yourself.<P>(edited cuz I was still pissed off.) <p>[This message has been edited by stimpy (edited 12-29-2000).]||||reg||1
